          <div class="engagement-grid">
            <article>
              <span class="eyebrow">[ 01 ] Automation</span>
              <h3>Makim</h3>
              <p>A task runner for repeatable development and research workflows,
                configured in YAML.</p>
              <a class="text-link" href="https://makim.org/"
                >Explore Makim <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
              >
            </article>
            <article>
              <span class="eyebrow">[ 02 ] Containers</span>
              <h3>Sugar</h3>
              <p>A tool for simplifying container workflows and managing
                configurations across environments.</p>
              <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/sugar-org/sugar"
                >Explore Sugar <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
              >
            </article>
            <article>
              <span class="eyebrow">[ 03 ] Literature data</span>
              <h3>PyMedX</h3>
              <p>A Python library for accessing PubMed, continued as a fork
                of the archived PyMed project.</p>
              <div class="inline-links">
                <a href="https://github.com/osl-incubator/pymedx">PyMedX ↗</a>
                <a href="https://github.com/gijswobben/pymed">Original PyMed ↗</a>
              </div>
            </article>
